OL,3,GNEWSAMotorist dies a week after crash
OL,4,Awith lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died a week after a crash
OL,7,Finvolving a lorry and a car at a
OL,8,Fcrossroads in Lincolnshire.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the collision
OL,11,Finvolving a DAF lorry and a silver Kia
OL,12,FSportage in Moulton, near Holbeach, at
OL,13,Fabout 13:20 BST on 16 October.
OL,15,FThe driver of the Kia was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital but died on Friday.
OL,18,FPolice said an investigation into the
OL,19,Fcrash was continuing and they appealed
OL,20,Ffor anyone who might have relevant
OL,21,Fdashcam or doorbell footage from before
OL,22,Fthe crash to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
